{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/ADD_Wishlist.gif?t=1746582305\" /><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Creator: Immerse Yourself in the World of Design</h2></strong><br>The Creator is a simulation game where you become a design master, creating stylish and cozy spaces in the most picturesque corners of the world. No limits, no stress \u2014 just creativity and inspiration!<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/BC_CR.gif?t=1746582305\" /><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Design Master</h2></strong><br>Use a variety of decor elements, furniture, plants, and landscape features to create unique interior and exterior designs.<br>Choose styles, colors, and materials to your liking, filling locations with an atmosphere of comfort and harmony.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/House_build.gif?t=1746582305\" /><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Location Variety</h2></strong><br>Customize cozy city apartments and residential homes of all kinds.<br>Garages and various rooms offer space for your unique ideas.<br>Enhance the setting with comfortable rest areas and functional elements.<br>Thousands of items await to be part of your design projects.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/Garden_garage.gif?t=1746582305\" /><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Creativity and Immersion</h2></strong><br>Forget about resource hunting and constraints \u2014 focus entirely on beauty creation.<br>Experiment freely, enjoying the process and finding perfect solutions.<br>Realistic day-night cycles and diverse weather conditions \u2014 from sunny days to thunderstorms with lightning \u2014 add depth and expressiveness to your creations.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/Camera.gif?t=1746582305\" /><br>Capture stunning photos of your projects with a customizable photo mode featuring various filters.<br>Share your best shots with friends and the gaming community, drawing inspiration from others\u2019 work.<br>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1940870?t=1746582305","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/9a298899a18e31c59978f4cf90576fa2e8b9e56b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746582305","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/8f2dd183920e78e009af7847d0a9a391b139b535/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746582305","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/8f2dd183920e78e009af7847d0a9a391b139b535/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746582305","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/ADD_Wishlist.gif?t=1746582305\" /><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Creator: Immerse Yourself in the World of Design</h2></strong><br>The Creator is a simulation game where you become a design master, creating stylish and cozy spaces in the most picturesque corners of the world. No limits, no stress \u2014 just creativity and inspiration!<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/BC_CR.gif?t=1746582305\" /><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Design Master</h2></strong><br>Use a variety of decor elements, furniture, plants, and landscape features to create unique interior and exterior designs.<br>Choose styles, colors, and materials to your liking, filling locations with an atmosphere of comfort and harmony.<br><img class=\"bb_im